<title>USA: CBOE to list Trico Marine options on June 26.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Trico Marine options on June 26.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Monday it will trade options on Trico Marine Services from June 26.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will open with strike prices of 20, 22-1/2 and 25, with initial expirations in July, August, November and February.</p>
<p>Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg has been named the designated primary market maker (DPM).</p>
<p>Monday afternoon, Trico Marine shares were down 7/16 at 22-15/16.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
